    "text": "<p>A red <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>D</mi></math> emits light at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>watt</mi></math> uniformly around it. The amplitude of the electric field of the light at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> from the diode is:</p>"
